Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:44.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}福基纳 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}5{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}7 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}4 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 兹维列夫 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Alejandro, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿莱汉德罗 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Wow. The turnaround started
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,哇 这场逆转始于
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:07.04,EN,,0,0,0,,with this unbelievable set point
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个不可思议的盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.32,EN,,0,0,0,,in the second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:10.72,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you do today to turn this around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:10.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天做了什么扭转了局势
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and win?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下胜利？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, like every match that I play here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 和我在这打的每场一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,doesn't matter the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,结果不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Just thinking in every ball, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,只想着每一分 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:23.84,EN,,0,0,0,,at the end, I knew that if I stay all match,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后 我知道只要全场咬住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:26.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I can have at least one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:26.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,至少能等来一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, I took it from the second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,对 第二盘我抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and third set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,第三盘也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:33.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I was better physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得第三盘我的体能更好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:35.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I was more excited than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我比他更兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.60,EN,,0,0,0,,No, after the second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 在拿下第二盘之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:40.08,EN,,0,0,0,,So the early break
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以第三盘开局的破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:42.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in the third set gave me a lot of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,给了我很大的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:47.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, I just focus on just keep playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就专注于继续打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:48.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and doesn't matter the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:48.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,不在乎结果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:50.56,EN,,0,0,0,,No, just enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 享受比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:51.04,EN,,0,0,0,,And you're back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:51.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你又回到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:53.60,EN,,0,0,0,,in the Masters final, first time in four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,大师赛决赛 时隔四年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:54.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You talked about how tough it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:54.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说过这个夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:55.92,EN,,0,0,0,,was this summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,有多艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:59.28,EN,,0,0,0,,you missed two months from the tour
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你离开巡回赛两个月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in some way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,某种程度上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Has that changed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这改变了你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Have you come back a different version
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是不是以一个不同的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,回来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I think you can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想你们能看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.04,EN,,0,0,0,,No, at the end it's not easy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 说到底 离开不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,when you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,当你远离的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.28,EN,,0,0,0,,No, so you have a lot of time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 你有很多时间思考
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.40,EN,,0,0,0,,And at the end you don't realize, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,说到底你意识不到的 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,When you are on tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,当你在巡回赛中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, at the end we are very privileged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道的 我们是多么幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:21.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to be here, to play this sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,能站在这里打这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:23.36,EN,,0,0,0,,It's very, for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说 这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:26.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I think before I was not enjoying, I was very
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:26.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得以前不享受 很沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:30.16,EN,,0,0,0,,frustrated and this kind of time gave me a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这段时间给了我很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.16,0:01:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,of thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.16,0:01:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,思考
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to see what I want to do with my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,去想我的未来要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Beautiful. Congrats and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,说得好 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:37.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,决赛见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:39.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
